MERCUDA is based on MERCURY6 by John E. Chambers (1999 and later updates),
including the upstream distribution maintained at https://github.com/smirik/mercury.
Original author and modification notices are retained in the source files.

MERCUDA contains modifications by HBJ1004 and contributors, including CUDA
backends, additional forces, input and scheduling changes, and validated
postprocessors. These modifications were made through 5 October 2026.

